<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loin prices ranged steady to $4.00 higher; buts steady to $3.00 higher; skinned hams $2.00 higher; seedless bellies steady; lean trimmings steady to $2.00 lower. - USDA</p>
<p>Trading was very slow, with light to moderate demand and offerings.</p>
